experimental: radical simplification — remove dead code, eliminate duplication, collapse abstractions (#253)

39 files changed, ~1000 net lines removed.

## Dead code removed
- 5 dead `CompiledGraph` fields (`ExprPaths`, `ExprAccessModes`,
`DynamicGVKNodes`, `ChildTopologies`, `TypeCacheGen`) — written but
never read in production
- `graph/hash.go` — dead content-hash infrastructure for unimplemented
optimization
- `Topology.nodeSelfPaths/nodeDepPaths`, `Node.SelfPaths/DepPaths`,
`ForEachBinding.CollectionSource` — pre-staged optimization with real
allocation cost per reconcile
- `walkResult.scope/nodeReady/forEach` — written, never read by callers
- `resyncCorrection bool` — dead parameter threaded through 5 function
signatures
- `forEachCarryForward.items` — write-only phantom state
- `reconcileState.topologicalOrder` — dead field with dead guard
- `instanceState.spec` — set but never read
- `PlanState.SetState` vestigial `dag` parameter
- `FinalizeSkippedStates`, `NodeStateCount` — exported with zero
production callers
- `gateDispatch` constant — defined, never tested in production
- `pruneOrder` — production-dead, replaced by `pruneOrderApplied`

## Duplication eliminated
- `main_test.go` migrated to `testenv.Environment` (-320 lines)
- `graphReady*` extractors collapsed via generic `conditionField`
- `pruneOrder`/`pruneOrderApplied` unified via `buildKeyPositionMap`
- `fieldpath.go` shared `walkAST` + `astVisitor` deduplicates 2 parallel
AST walkers
- `runFinalization`/`runForEachFinalization` share
`ensureFinalizerResource`
- `AllExpressions`/`ExtractReferencedPathsFromNode` share
`WalkExpressions` helper
- Misc inlines: `createRevision`, `isAPIServerManager`,
`collectAllDAGs`, `reverse`, CRD test builders, duplicate `stubResolver`
types

## Abstractions removed
- `GVKScopeResolver` single-impl interface → concrete `*scopeResolver`
- `WatchCoordinator.Watches` public field → unexported with delegation
- `SetOnEvent`/`SetOnNewType` setters → constructor parameters
- 11 symbols unexported (condition types, finalization phase, watch
events, `CompiledGraph` internals)
- `forceApply: "true"` string form removed (undocumented, not in any
design)
- `pruneReleased` outcome removed (patches skip verification via type
check, not outcome)

## Stale comments and naming
- 9 stale/misleading comments fixed
- `resource.gvr` renamed to `resource.obj`
- `LabelValue()` delegates to `String()`
- `conditionsSchemaProperties` → `conditionsSchema` (removed wrapper
map)
- `celReadyFunction`/`celUpdatedFunction` wrappers inlined
